  "body": "The CSS text 3 spec [suggests a UA stylesheet for the option element](https://www.w3.org/TR/css-text-3/#default-stylesheet):\r\n\r\n> ```css\r\n> /* make option elements align together */\r\n> option { text-align: match-parent; }\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nThis probably should be normatively defined in the HTML spec instead.\r\n\r\n[This 'match-parent' value](https://www.w3.org/TR/css-text-3/#valdef-text-align-match-parent) makes the desired alignment consistent in bidi situations.",
